{"id":"steam-1069170","steam":1069170,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Diggers Down","summary":"Diggers Down is a casual turn-based puzzle game about carving a path deep through the randomly generated earth.\r\nNavigate your way down, shape your route and collect treasure along the way. \r\nHow deep can you go? The diggers depend on you!","about":"Diggers Down is a casual turn-based puzzle game about carving a path deep through the randomly generated earth.\n\nNavigate your way down, shape your route and collect treasure along the way. \n\nHow deep can you go? The diggers depend on you!\n\nGame Features\n\nPuzzling Gameplay - Place randomized pieces to construct a route through the earth, collecting treasures and finding your way deeper underground.\n\nNew Puzzles Every Game - Randomized levels and pieces create new layouts and decisions every time you play.\n\nTurn-Based Gameplay - Take your time with each move and play at your own pace.\n\nEasy to Learn - Simple rules and no text make it easy to get started, while randomized levels give new problems to solve.\n\nSimple Mouse Controls - Entire game can be played with only the mouse. No keyboard required.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1069170/fbd73fc3a436560d2a03a8247d54ca78384c1d9d/library_capsule.jpg?t=1792291346","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1069170/f782dd2e4975fba98fbbae868c94d77f5c33e7c6/header.jpg?t=1792291346","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1069170/090cef77ff8c1de5438c4e9657263a5394025f11/library_hero.jpg?t=1792291346","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1069170/f782dd2e4975fba98fbbae868c94d77f5c33e7c6/header.jpg?t=1792291346","background":null,"screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1069170/7760069cf3c69bcfa492b91f24a8ffc1c27f2a87/ss_7760069cf3c69bcfa492b91f24a8ffc1c27f